-- Comic edition (2026-11-16): the Super faction is played from the artwork in comics/.
-- Cosmic Warden (61) and Multiverse Phantom (66) are redesigned as a two-card pair, and
-- 71-78 are new designs for artwork that had no catalog entry. Edit freely; IDs stay stable.
-- Card flags read by battle.lua:
--   replaces = id   the Unit is played onto a friendly Unit with that id and takes its place
--   agent    = true the Unit is deployed on the opponent's battlefield and becomes their card
--   wild     = true counts as every faction for abilities that take cards from a discard pile

